<title>USA: Fulton to move to Nasdaq National Market.</title>
<headline>Fulton to move to Nasdaq National Market.</headline>
<dateline>FULTON, Mo. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fulton Bancorp Inc, holding company for Fulton Savings Bank FSB, said Thursday that it was approved for listing on the Nasdaq National Market, effective March 17.</p>
<p>Fulton currently trades on the Nasdaq Small Cap Market.</p>
<p>Established in 1912, Fulton Savings at December 31, 1996 had assets of $99.5 million.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
